Why AI Can Sound Right and Be Wrong
📘 Micro-learning
Fluency is not accuracy
● AI is trained to sound confident
● Confidence does not signal correctness
● Missing information leads to confident guesses
Example prompt
“Answer this, then list what assumptions you made due to missing information.”


❓ Micro-assessment (Scenario)
AI gives a confident answer. What’s the best next step?
A. Use it
B. Assume it’s correct
C. Ask what assumptions it made ✅
D. Ignore it
Coaching
● ✅ Correct: Assumptions reveal accuracy risks.
● ❌ Not quite: Confidence alone is not a quality signal.

🎯 Micro-action
Ask AI to identify assumptions in one response today.
